{
 "title": "Requesting a Non-Catalog Item or Service",
 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>Requesting a Non-Catalog Item or Service</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"If you can't find the items you need by searching or browsing the customer catalog, you can create a non-catalog request. You complete a few fields to describe what you need so that a purchasing agent can locate and order the items for you.\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"If you can't find the items you need by searching or browsing the customer catalog, you can create a non-catalog request. You complete a few fields to describe what you need so that a purchasing agent can locate and order the items for you.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"></script></head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled collapsify-enabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page task  - topic-topic task-task \" id=\"loioef3b514729764dae87fc1871b74bab85\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">Requesting a Non-Catalog Item or Service</h1><div class=\"body taskbody\"><p class=\"shortdesc\">If you can't find the items you need by searching or browsing the customer catalog,\nyou can create a non-catalog request. You complete a few fields to describe what you need so\nthat a purchasing agent can locate and order the items for you.</p>\n<div class=\"section context\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Context</h2></div>\n<p class=\"p\">Watch the interactive tutorial for step-by-step instructions; all tutorials are\ncaptioned exclusively in English:</p>\n<a class=\"xref\" href=\"https://education.hana.ondemand.com/education/wa/aribanc/%7Etag/published/index.html?show=project!PR_9E3C382A5C25C391:uebung#TS_39323DF7B5214A6BA5FFA889B11680B5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://education.hana.ondemand.com/education/wa/aribanc/%7Etag/published/index.html?show=project!PR_9E3C382A5C25C391:uebung#TS_39323DF7B5214A6BA5FFA889B11680B5\" title=\"https://education.hana.ondemand.com/education/wa/aribanc/%7Etag/published/index.html?show=project!PR_9E3C382A5C25C391:uebung#TS_39323DF7B5214A6BA5FFA889B11680B5\">Buying Non-Catalog Items.</a>\n<p class=\"p\">\n<a class=\"xref\" href=\"https://education.hana.ondemand.com/education/wa/aribanc/%7Etag/published/index.html?show=project!PR_9E3C382A5C25C391:uebung#TS_39323DF7B5214A6BA5FFA889B11680B5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://education.hana.ondemand.com/education/wa/aribanc/%7Etag/published/index.html?show=project!PR_9E3C382A5C25C391:uebung#TS_39323DF7B5214A6BA5FFA889B11680B5\" title=\"https://education.hana.ondemand.com/education/wa/aribanc/%7Etag/published/index.html?show=project!PR_9E3C382A5C25C391:uebung#TS_39323DF7B5214A6BA5FFA889B11680B5\">\n<img class=\"inline\" id=\"loioef3b514729764dae87fc1871b74bab85__image_svq_ljt_pwb\" src=\"loio8934a50e4ee04b7f86f2fc4c2ffb9807_LowRes.png\">\n</a>\n</p>\n<p class=\"p\">Consider the following when you create a non-catalog request:</p><ul class=\"ul\">\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Your administrator might prevent you from ordering non-catalog items, in which\ncase the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Request a non-catalog item</span> option won't\ndisplay.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">You can't create service requisitions containing hierarchical items using\nthe<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\"> Request a non-catalog item</span> option.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">You can add a maximum of 200 line items and 100 comments per request.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">If you use a custom line-item form, you can add a maximum of 20 line items per\nrequest.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Non-catalog requests might take longer to process than customer catalog\norders.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">If your organization uses service orders and service sheets, you'll see both a\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Goods</span> and <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Services</span> form. If you\nsee only the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Goods</span> form, this means your organization\nallows only non-catalog requests for goods.</p></li>\n</ul></div>\n<section class=\"section procedure\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"ol steps tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Procedure</h2></div><ol class=\"ol steps\"><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">On the right side of your dashboard, click <span class=\"ph menucascade\"><img src=\"themes/sap-light/img/navstart.gif\" alt=\"Start of the navigation path\" title=\"Start of the navigation path\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Quick Links</span>&nbsp;<img src=\"themes/sap-light/img/navstep.gif\" alt=\"Next navigation step\" title=\"Next navigation step\">&nbsp;<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Request a non-catalog item</span><img src=\"themes/sap-light/img/navend.gif\" alt=\"End of the navigation path\" title=\"End of the navigation path\"></span> or the plus symbol (<span class=\"SAP-icons-V5\"></span>).</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Choose either the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Goods</span> or <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Services</span>\ntab.</span><div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<aside class=\"note tip\" aria-labelledby=\"n0t\"><div class=\"title\" id=\"n0t\"><strong>Tip</strong></div>\n<p>In most cases, if you're buying an item that will be delivered to\nyou, choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Goods</span>. If you're requesting a service that will\nbe performed, choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Services</span>.</p></aside>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">In the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Product name</span> or <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Service name</span>\nfield, enter a name for the product or service you need.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">For the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Category</span> field, choose the category that most\naccurately describes what you're requesting.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<p class=\"p\">Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Browse all</span> from the dropdown menu to see all\ncategories.</p>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Guided buying might display a <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Recommended alternatives from\ncatalog</span> carousel, which uses artificial intelligence to find up to\nfive items related to the item you entered. Ordering recommended items is simpler and\nfaster than creating a non-catalog request.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<p class=\"p\"><img class=\"inline\" id=\"loioef3b514729764dae87fc1871b74bab85__image_o1w_mz1_qzb\" src=\"loio770664cd7a2a494394e89a3b1ea27fca_LowRes.png\"></p>\n<p class=\"p\">Click any item in the carousel to display more information and to add it to the\ncart.</p>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">If you are requesting a service, use the calendar icon (<span class=\"SAP-icons-V5\"></span>) to choose a start date and end date.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Add a supplier to your non-catalog request:</span>\n<ul class=\"ul choices\" id=\"loioef3b514729764dae87fc1871b74bab85__choices_fjd_z5h_nx\">\n<li class=\"li choice\"><p>To order from a preferred supplier for the given category, choose one of the\nsuppliers under <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Recommended suppliers for you</span>.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li choice\"><p>Click <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">View all suppliers</span> to choose a supplier from\nyour organization's list of suppliers. You can search by supplier name or supplier\nkeyword.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Enter a detailed description of the good or service.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">If you are ordering a product, complete the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Quantity</span> and\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Unit of measure</span> fields.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Enter the price and currency for the good or service.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<div class=\"p\">\n<aside class=\"note\" aria-labelledby=\"n1t\"><div class=\"title\" id=\"n1t\"><strong>Note</strong></div>\n<p>The default currency is derived from the country/region associated with your\nship-to address or plant. For example, if you have a ship-to country/region of\nthe United States, your currency default to USD.</p></aside>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Click <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Add to cart</span>.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">After you add the first item to the shopping cart, you can click:</span>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table border=\"1\" frame=\"border\" rules=\"rows\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"0\" summary=\"\" class=\"simpletable choicetable choicetableborder\" id=\"loioef3b514729764dae87fc1871b74bab85__choicetable_mwq_swr_ckb\"><col style=\"width:50%\"><col style=\"width:50%\"><thead><tr class=\"sthead chhead\"><th class=\"stentry choptionhd\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d7944e292-option\">Option</th><th class=\"stentry chdeschd\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d7944e292-desc\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d7944e292-option\" id=\"d7944e296\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Done</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d7944e292-desc d7944e296\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>Returns to the home page</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d7944e292-option\" id=\"d7944e308\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">More options</span> menu (<span class=\"SAP-icons-V5\"></span>) &gt; <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Create new</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d7944e292-desc d7944e308\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>Clears the page and allows you to create another non-catalog line and add\nit to the shopping cart</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d7944e292-option\" id=\"d7944e337\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">More options</span> menu (<span class=\"SAP-icons-V5\"></span>) &gt; <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Copy</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d7944e292-desc d7944e337\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>Leaves the existing information on the page and allows you to edit it to\ncreate another non-catalog line</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table></div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">To check out, click <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Check out</span>.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">To see additional fields, click the right arrow to expand a line item. Edit fields\nthat have incorrect information.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<div class=\"p\">\n<aside class=\"note\" aria-labelledby=\"n2t\"><div class=\"title\" id=\"n2t\"><strong>Note</strong></div>\n<p class=\"p\">If you use contracts, select a contract number by clicking the\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Contract</span> field and then clicking <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Browse\nall</span>; don't select one from the recent-contracts list, because\nit could contain contracts for other suppliers.</p></aside>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Click <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Submit</span>.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">A confirmation dialog box displays. Click <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Done</span> to go to the\nhome page.</span>\n</li></ol></section>\n<div class=\"section postreq\" id=\"loioef3b514729764dae87fc1871b74bab85__postreq_lpt_4xv_plb\"><div class=\"tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Next Steps</h2></div>\n<p class=\"p\">After you submit a request, you can check on the status periodically, see <a class=\"xref\" href=\"77dcef906e6947eb947524bf5cb07434.html\" title=\"You can check the status of your requests to see when they're fully approved, or to find out when you'll receive the items or service. You can also find the request history to find if the order was sent to the supplier.\">Finding the Status of Your Requests</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"p\">If you need to withdraw a submitted request, choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Withdraw</span> to\nstop the approval process and revert the document back to\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Composing</span> state. You can leave a reason for withdrawing the\nrequest in the<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Comments</span> section.</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"related-links\"> <br><ul class=\"ullinks\"><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"b12a15a2eb7344d1b3af291aaa7a4859.html\" title=\"Your organization might allow you to mitigate potential risk with non-catalog purchases. The risk exposure score displays when you select a supplier for these purchases.\">Mitigating Risk for Non-Catalog Purchases</a></strong><br></div><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"d848c425286f4058830b6786383472de.html\" title=\"When you submit an engagement request, the supplier is evaluated by risk experts in SAP Ariba Supplier Risk. Engagement requests examine suppliers on a deeper level and help your organization better mitigate risk.\">Workflow for Non-Catalog Engagement Requests</a></strong><br></div><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"6a405bfb22ea4772a08fcccb3be9f1e9.html\" title=\"You can use ad hoc vendors for non-catalog requests in guided buying.\">Requesting a Non-Catalog Item with an Ad Hoc Vendor</a></strong><br></div><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"69fc1bcbe69c4caba3ffab15d1ee1c1c.html\" title=\"A service hierarchy request consists of a parent item (service-based) and child items related to the service.\">Requesting a Service Hierarchy Item</a></strong><br></div></ul></div></div></section><div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div></div></div></body></html>"
}